WEBVTT

00:06.210 --> 00:08.210
This is ridiculous.

00:08.500 --> 00:11.090
What do you mean,
"I'll support you by your side"?

00:11.170 --> 00:13.720
What do you mean,
"Shut up and take my hand"?

00:13.800 --> 00:15.800
This is so embarrassing.

00:18.850 --> 00:19.930
Alya.

00:20.180 --> 00:22.310
She did say "like", didn't she?

00:24.850 --> 00:27.190
Is the dere attitude
she sometimes shows in Russian

00:27.270 --> 00:29.320
not just a game?

00:29.650 --> 00:32.950
I thought she was enjoying
the thrill of possibly getting caught.

00:33.360 --> 00:35.910
But if that's what Alya really thinks...

00:37.700 --> 00:38.700
No, it's impossible.

00:39.580 --> 00:40.620
She must be like me,

00:40.700 --> 00:42.870
saying the wrong thing
in the heat of the moment.

00:42.960 --> 00:44.580
She must've come to her senses

00:44.670 --> 00:47.000
and almost drowned
in shame and regret by now.

00:47.420 --> 00:49.550
Yes, I have a feeling that's the case.

00:53.260 --> 00:54.800
Work again?

00:54.880 --> 00:57.590
You don't even come home.

00:57.680 --> 01:00.510
Goodness, you're always like this.

01:00.600 --> 01:02.600
Do you think an apology
will fix everything?

01:03.480 --> 01:04.890
I feel like an idiot

01:04.980 --> 01:08.900
to worry about such
an uncertain and vague emotion like love.

01:10.070 --> 01:12.030
I will support her?

01:12.530 --> 01:16.570
I, the one who dumped the burden
of the Suou family on Yuki and ran away?

01:17.070 --> 01:18.320
That's funny.

01:23.250 --> 01:26.290
Didn't she say she was busy?

01:27.460 --> 01:28.330
No.

01:28.420 --> 01:29.630
If what happened today

01:29.710 --> 01:32.710
was a trap to get me
to join the student council,

01:32.800 --> 01:35.670
she must be a part of it too.

01:38.180 --> 01:39.140
What?

03:04.180 --> 03:05.510
(Alya Sometimes Hides Her Feelings in Russian)

03:14.270 --> 03:16.280
(Episode 5: Each One's Resolution)

03:16.360 --> 03:18.280
Masachika, you pervert!

03:18.360 --> 03:21.200
You waited until the right time
to come out, didn't you?

03:21.280 --> 03:22.110
Did you notice?

03:22.200 --> 03:23.240
Of course I did.

03:24.660 --> 03:28.790
You came out because you heard me
close the main door, didn't you?

03:29.160 --> 03:31.000
Hey... wait a minute.

03:31.080 --> 03:34.500
Aren't you curious why I'm doing this?

03:34.590 --> 03:36.300
Anyway, put on some clothes first.

03:36.380 --> 03:38.840
Don't be like that.
Let me explain, Masachika.

03:39.300 --> 03:43.010
Actually, I just realized a grave matter.

03:43.090 --> 03:44.470
A grave matter?

03:44.890 --> 03:46.010
That's right.

03:46.100 --> 03:49.100
We've been living together
for a long time,

03:50.140 --> 03:53.810
but we haven't experienced
the "walk-in on someone changing event"!

03:53.900 --> 03:55.440
That's worse than I thought!

03:55.520 --> 03:56.820
Every brother in the world

03:56.900 --> 03:59.320
wants to bump into
his sister changing, right?

03:59.400 --> 04:01.490
That only works in 2D, you otaku brain!

04:01.570 --> 04:03.410
I don't want to hear that from you!

04:03.740 --> 04:06.200
And so, here's a fan service shot.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.330
Oh, no.

04:07.410 --> 04:08.990
Who are you talking to?

04:09.080 --> 04:09.910
What?

04:10.000 --> 04:11.460
The camera that idiots can't see.

04:11.540 --> 04:13.080
Is it only for nude scenes?

04:13.670 --> 04:14.500
All right.

04:14.580 --> 04:16.210
That's enough messing around.

04:16.290 --> 04:20.710
I got you good today,
so this is my way of making it up to you.

04:20.800 --> 04:23.430
Don't you dare apologize naked.

04:23.510 --> 04:25.970
Hey, I just didn't talk back to you.

04:26.180 --> 04:28.220
Why are you so full of yourself?

04:28.310 --> 04:32.180
I know you've already checked me out
from head to toe and enjoyed it.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.560
Yuki.

04:35.400 --> 04:36.690
While we're at it,

04:36.770 --> 04:38.110
I have to say this.

04:39.150 --> 04:41.570
I'll go soft if it's full nudity.

04:42.280 --> 04:44.490
Subtle sexiness is justice.

04:44.910 --> 04:46.110
What?

04:47.280 --> 04:48.700
I see.

04:48.780 --> 04:50.410
That's indeed a blind spot.

04:50.790 --> 04:51.750
Total victory.

04:53.870 --> 04:55.290
Hey, wait.

04:55.370 --> 04:56.960
You can't fool me.

04:57.040 --> 04:58.420
You saw everything, right?

04:58.500 --> 05:01.840
Clearly from head to toe, right?

05:03.380 --> 05:05.220
I only saw boobs.

05:05.300 --> 05:07.510
You finally admit it, you Boob Alien!

05:07.590 --> 05:09.220
Shut up, you nympho!

05:11.770 --> 05:13.890
By the way, Masachika.

05:13.980 --> 05:15.520
What?

05:15.600 --> 05:16.480
By the way,

05:16.560 --> 05:19.730
why did you come to my room
to dry your hair so naturally?

05:20.270 --> 05:22.730
Did you decide to join the student council

05:22.820 --> 05:25.200
after talking to the president and Masha?

05:28.160 --> 05:30.780
Well, about that...

05:34.370 --> 05:35.210
I decided

05:35.870 --> 05:38.580
to help Alya become
the student council president.

05:44.300 --> 05:48.510
Alya snagged my brother
by sleeping with him!

05:48.590 --> 05:50.010
No, I wasn't!

05:50.100 --> 05:52.600
Damn it, you Boob Alien!

05:52.680 --> 05:56.100
Does that mean
you're not satisfied with my C cup?

05:56.190 --> 06:00.150
How could you be fooled so easily
by Alya's E cup (eyeballing)?

06:00.230 --> 06:02.860
Don't say explicit things like cup sizes!

06:03.110 --> 06:04.900
Calm down, brassiere.

06:04.990 --> 06:06.400
No, brother.

06:06.490 --> 06:07.610
A C-cup you can touch

06:07.700 --> 06:10.490
is far better than
an E-cup you can't touch.

06:10.570 --> 06:12.830
No, I can't touch either of them.

06:12.910 --> 06:14.620
All right, bring it on!

06:14.700 --> 06:16.540
Please be gentle with me!

06:16.620 --> 06:18.790
Why are you so excited to try it?

06:18.870 --> 06:21.130
Well, what should I do?

06:21.210 --> 06:24.420
Should I take away
my sister's first boob touch?

06:24.800 --> 06:26.300
Don't say that.

06:26.380 --> 06:27.590
Just kidding.

06:27.670 --> 06:31.140
After all, you took it away
when I was in elementary school.

06:31.220 --> 06:32.430
I don't remember that.

06:33.140 --> 06:34.010
What?

06:34.260 --> 06:36.140
What? Are you serious?

06:37.180 --> 06:38.310
Brother.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.900
Have you forgotten?

06:40.350 --> 06:43.190
That was when I was in second grade.

06:43.570 --> 06:45.030
What?

06:45.360 --> 06:48.570
While playing tag,
we bumped into each other.

06:48.650 --> 06:51.240
Your face was planted
in the middle of my thigh

06:51.320 --> 06:53.990
and your hand was squeezing my right boob!

06:54.080 --> 06:56.700
I don't remember such a miracle happening!

06:56.790 --> 06:59.710
Don't make up such
a ridiculous lucky perverted event!

07:00.250 --> 07:01.960
You just clicked your tongue, right?

07:02.670 --> 07:03.710
Seriously.

07:03.790 --> 07:06.130
You had bad asthma at that time.

07:06.210 --> 07:08.340
Basically, you couldn't go outside.

07:08.420 --> 07:11.720
But I'm a healthy baby now.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.850
I haven't caught a cold since junior high.

07:13.930 --> 07:16.600
I'd rather you behave yourself.

07:17.100 --> 07:18.100
Did I not?

07:18.180 --> 07:19.810
Both at school and at home!

07:19.890 --> 07:20.810
I'm sorry.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.310
Don't apologize.

07:22.400 --> 07:23.520
Spoil me more.

07:29.360 --> 07:31.070
Thank you.

07:41.670 --> 07:42.880
I see.

07:43.170 --> 07:46.590
You've decided to run with Alya?

07:47.050 --> 07:48.050
Yes.

07:48.300 --> 07:49.420
I'm sorry.

07:50.380 --> 07:53.090
It's nothing to apologize for.

07:53.590 --> 07:56.430
A sibling rivalry is the way to go.
How passionate it'd be.

07:58.220 --> 08:00.180
I'll tell you this just in case.

08:00.270 --> 08:03.020
I'm doing this not because I hate you.

08:03.400 --> 08:04.520
I know.

08:05.190 --> 08:07.110
After all,

08:07.190 --> 08:09.190
you love me the most, don't you?

08:11.070 --> 08:12.400
I guess so.

08:12.860 --> 08:14.320
You're blushing.

08:14.410 --> 08:15.280
Shut up.

08:17.410 --> 08:18.990
That's good enough.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.120
Really?

08:20.200 --> 08:21.790
Yes, thank you.

08:23.670 --> 08:24.790
Well then.

08:24.880 --> 08:27.590
From now on, we're rivals.

08:28.460 --> 08:29.670
Right.

08:31.260 --> 08:35.010
I don't mind you having an affair
with a girl who's at your beck and call.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.260
If you ever get tired of Alya,

08:37.350 --> 08:39.470
you can always change your mind
and come to me.

08:39.890 --> 08:42.310
Wait, don't call it an affair.

08:42.680 --> 08:44.190
I won't do that.

08:45.190 --> 08:48.400
You'll come back to me in the end.

08:49.860 --> 08:51.610
Are you some kind of perfect woman?

08:53.490 --> 08:54.400
Good night.

08:54.610 --> 08:56.070
Bye.

09:00.290 --> 09:01.410
I see.

09:01.500 --> 09:04.620
Have you finally found someone
who can motivate you?

09:07.580 --> 09:09.710
Can't it be me?

09:10.550 --> 09:11.880
Whatever, but

09:12.550 --> 09:14.090
I won't lose.

09:24.100 --> 09:25.020
Usually,

09:25.100 --> 09:26.980
she would come here and make a scene.

09:27.520 --> 09:30.900
Did I hurt her feelings yesterday?

09:33.490 --> 09:35.400
She's not that kind of person.

09:35.990 --> 09:37.070
But

09:37.160 --> 09:39.320
I have to make it up to her somehow.

09:48.080 --> 09:50.710
Did you think I'd end it
with the serious part?

09:50.790 --> 09:51.840
What a shame.

09:51.920 --> 09:54.630
I'm a woman of my word!

09:55.010 --> 09:57.380
Goodness, you're really...

09:59.800 --> 10:00.640
Heave-ho.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.560
What?

10:03.430 --> 10:05.180
Pull me out.

10:08.020 --> 10:09.020
I'm stuck.

10:09.860 --> 10:14.110
Don't make me say it out loud.
It's embarrassing.

10:18.860 --> 10:20.660
What are you doing?

10:20.740 --> 10:22.910
Darn it. I'm going to bury you.

10:22.990 --> 10:24.580
Darn you.

10:25.450 --> 10:27.870
It's the stench of a man.
I'm going to get pregnant.

10:27.960 --> 10:28.790
That's impossible!

10:28.870 --> 10:30.790
Are you some kind of sheltered lady?

10:30.880 --> 10:33.880
I am a sheltered lady.
What's wrong with that?

10:38.090 --> 10:38.930
Good morning.

10:39.220 --> 10:40.640
Did you watch yesterday's drama?

10:40.720 --> 10:42.800
It was really good.

10:42.890 --> 10:44.810
Yes, it made my heart flutter.

10:52.560 --> 10:54.900
Why do I care so much?

10:54.980 --> 10:58.110
I'm sure he'll come to school
with a sleepy face like always.

10:58.490 --> 11:00.610
I'll just get along with him as usual.

11:00.700 --> 11:02.200
Masachika, good morning.

11:02.280 --> 11:03.780
Good morning, Masachika.

11:03.870 --> 11:05.200
Good morning.

11:06.160 --> 11:07.580
Good morning, Alya.

11:07.660 --> 11:08.790
Good morning.

11:08.870 --> 11:09.710
Kuze.

11:10.000 --> 11:12.000
Are you previewing the material?

11:12.880 --> 11:14.710
Y-Yes.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.210
What's the matter?

11:17.300 --> 11:19.010
What? Nothing.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.220
Is that so?

11:25.220 --> 11:26.140
Masachika.

11:26.220 --> 11:27.810
Takeshi and I were talking.

11:27.890 --> 11:29.180
Should we go to karaoke next?

11:29.480 --> 11:31.310
Sure. When?

11:31.400 --> 11:34.110
Kuze seems kind of down.

11:34.190 --> 11:36.650
(Alya's Perspective)
He's giving off a somewhat ethereal vibe.

11:37.110 --> 11:39.490
He even looks kind of cool.

11:40.200 --> 11:42.360
What am I thinking?

11:42.450 --> 11:43.280
It's nothing.

11:43.370 --> 11:45.620
I'm sure he didn't get enough sleep again.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.290
He isn't sleeping.

11:51.370 --> 11:52.620
Why?

11:54.330 --> 11:56.210
Is he really going

11:56.300 --> 11:59.800
to change his habits for my sake?

12:00.260 --> 12:01.590
From now on,

12:01.680 --> 12:03.590
I'll support you by your side.

12:04.300 --> 12:05.300
Kujou!

12:13.350 --> 12:14.650
(Team A, Team B)

12:16.610 --> 12:17.730
She's so cool!

12:17.820 --> 12:19.400
Kujou is so amazing!

12:21.610 --> 12:22.610
Kuze!

12:22.860 --> 12:24.410
Hey, are you okay?

12:25.280 --> 12:26.700
Your eyes are rolled back!

12:30.080 --> 12:31.830
I told you, "The ball is my friend"

12:31.910 --> 12:34.080
is just a fantasy.

12:37.460 --> 12:39.000
I'm so hungry.

12:39.090 --> 12:41.220
Kuze, are you all right?

12:42.970 --> 12:44.010
Alya?

12:44.470 --> 12:45.590
Why are you out here?

12:45.680 --> 12:48.510
I was wondering if you were hurt.

12:48.600 --> 12:50.770
You saw everything.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.310
Are you all right?

12:52.390 --> 12:53.810
Do you want to see the nurse?

12:53.890 --> 12:55.690
No, I'm fine.

12:55.770 --> 12:58.320
The gym was a bit hot,
so I came out for some fresh air.

12:58.400 --> 13:00.320
I'll go back after a short rest.

13:01.070 --> 13:02.280
I see.

13:02.650 --> 13:03.490
Let me check.

13:03.570 --> 13:04.530
What?

13:09.160 --> 13:11.830
It's hard to tell like this.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.710
Is... is that so?

13:15.170 --> 13:16.330
E-cup.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.840
Seriously?

13:18.290 --> 13:19.210
No, wait.

13:19.290 --> 13:20.800
If she was just eyeballing them,

13:20.880 --> 13:23.720
could they be bigger?

13:38.400 --> 13:40.610
What? A glimpse of the armpit?

13:40.690 --> 13:42.690
Damn it, did you do that on purpose?

13:44.490 --> 13:46.450
Yuki! This is what I meant.

13:46.530 --> 13:48.530
Sure enough, subtle sexiness is justice!

13:51.540 --> 13:52.620
What's wrong?

13:52.700 --> 13:54.290
Nothing.

13:55.620 --> 13:56.620
Anyway,

13:56.710 --> 13:58.580
you'd better drink some water.

14:20.020 --> 14:22.400
What? Wait, Kuze.

14:22.480 --> 14:24.110
What are you doing?

14:25.650 --> 14:26.570
Nothing.

14:26.650 --> 14:29.410
I just wanted to clear my head physically.

14:29.490 --> 14:31.120
I see.

14:31.370 --> 14:32.700
Oh my, Kuze?

14:33.870 --> 14:35.330
What's wrong?

14:35.410 --> 14:37.710
Are you trying to be a sweaty hunk?

14:38.170 --> 14:39.710
Hello, Masha.

14:39.960 --> 14:42.130
I just wanted to clear my head.

14:42.210 --> 14:43.130
Don't worry.

14:43.550 --> 14:44.800
What is it?

14:44.880 --> 14:46.590
Is something in the sky?

14:46.880 --> 14:48.090
Clouds.

14:48.550 --> 14:49.720
You're right.

14:50.220 --> 14:52.720
Why are you stating the obvious?

14:54.310 --> 14:56.180
Gym uniform

14:56.270 --> 14:58.480
is good stuff.

14:59.190 --> 15:00.770
You're soaking wet.

15:00.850 --> 15:01.980
Do you have a towel?

15:02.400 --> 15:04.730
No, I don't.

15:04.820 --> 15:06.740
But it'll dry up naturally.

15:06.990 --> 15:09.320
Come on, lower your head.

15:10.030 --> 15:11.990
What's going on?

15:12.070 --> 15:14.330
I didn't know such an event existed!

15:15.370 --> 15:17.580
Okay, it's dry.

15:18.660 --> 15:20.920
How is it? Do you feel more refreshed?

15:21.000 --> 15:22.420
Yes, I do.

15:22.500 --> 15:24.290
I think I know how it feels to be a dog.

15:24.500 --> 15:26.920
Are you an Akita Inu?

15:27.010 --> 15:28.800
No, I don't know breeds.

15:29.220 --> 15:30.300
I'm sorry.

15:30.380 --> 15:31.890
I'm just an uncultured mutt.

15:33.180 --> 15:36.640
Mischievous dogs are cute too.

15:37.720 --> 15:38.640
That's enough.

15:38.730 --> 15:40.270
Let's go back, Kuze.

15:40.770 --> 15:43.810
Masha, shouldn't you go back to class too?

15:44.190 --> 15:47.400
Hey, I just got here.

15:47.480 --> 15:49.490
We're going back.

15:49.990 --> 15:51.030
Okay.

15:52.990 --> 15:54.910
See you after school.

15:54.990 --> 15:56.790
Okay, see you after school.

15:57.160 --> 15:59.200
Thanks for the towel.

16:07.670 --> 16:09.300
I know what this is.

16:09.380 --> 16:12.300
It's the part where I'd be
called "dirty" or "obscene."

16:14.010 --> 16:14.890
So,

16:15.220 --> 16:16.680
are you okay now?

16:17.310 --> 16:18.140
What?

16:18.810 --> 16:19.730
The spot

16:19.810 --> 16:21.440
where you got hit by the ball.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.810
Are you sure you don't need ice on it?

16:26.570 --> 16:30.940
She thought I was using
cold water to ice my wound!

16:31.570 --> 16:33.700
No, I'm fine.

16:33.780 --> 16:35.780
It's not swollen anyway.

16:36.370 --> 16:37.410
Really?

16:37.700 --> 16:40.080
No need. I'm really fine.

16:40.700 --> 16:41.540
What's going on?

16:41.620 --> 16:43.420
Why is she being so gentle to me?

16:43.500 --> 16:44.330
The dere period?

16:44.420 --> 16:45.500
Is this the dere period?

16:49.880 --> 16:51.130
Alya.

16:51.420 --> 16:54.380
You seem to be especially
gentle to me today.

16:55.510 --> 16:56.430
That's because

16:56.800 --> 16:58.010
you've been a bit down

16:58.100 --> 16:59.970
since this morning.

17:00.060 --> 17:01.430
I'm just a bit worried

17:01.520 --> 17:03.690
that something happened to you.

17:07.650 --> 17:11.240
Just as I thought,
is it because of what happened yesterday?

17:12.280 --> 17:15.110
No, I'm not feeling down.

17:19.490 --> 17:23.000
I just didn't have breakfast.

17:28.290 --> 17:31.800
I was wondering why you
were so focused in class today.

17:31.880 --> 17:35.010
It turns out you couldn't sleep
because you were hungry.

17:35.380 --> 17:38.180
No, that's because
I had a good night's sleep.

17:40.970 --> 17:43.520
I see, a good night's sleep.

17:43.600 --> 17:46.900
But I couldn't sleep because of you.

17:47.690 --> 17:49.900
In the end, this unserious
and happy-go-lucky guy

17:49.980 --> 17:53.610
could sleep like it was nothing.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.860
I see!

17:57.490 --> 17:59.910
Well, Alya, listen carefully.

17:59.990 --> 18:01.370
This is what God said.

18:01.450 --> 18:02.290
What is it?

18:02.370 --> 18:05.540
Don't tell me you're going to say,
"Love your neighbors."

18:05.620 --> 18:06.620
No.

18:06.710 --> 18:08.380
This is what God said.

18:08.460 --> 18:10.170
If someone hits you on the right,

18:10.250 --> 18:12.920
turn your cheek
and let them hit you on the left.

18:13.880 --> 18:14.720
Goodness.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.800
Is that the look you give
to a masochist swine?

18:16.880 --> 18:19.600
It's a look I give
to a frivolous good-for-nothing.

18:21.050 --> 18:22.010
Goodness.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.890
I was worried for nothing.

18:24.180 --> 18:25.350
He's the worst.

18:25.430 --> 18:28.400
I knew I wouldn't fall for a frivolous guy like him.

18:31.360 --> 18:32.690
Thank goodness.

18:32.940 --> 18:34.690
It's the usual Alya.

18:39.740 --> 18:41.200
Alya.

18:41.280 --> 18:43.910
Do you want to go
to the student council office with me?

18:55.090 --> 18:57.220
Maybe I went too far.

18:59.680 --> 19:01.300
- We shall take our leave!
- We shall take our leave!

19:07.060 --> 19:09.310
The same guys
from the baseball and soccer club?

19:12.150 --> 19:13.440
Sorry to bother you.

19:19.360 --> 19:21.910
I'm sorry, I got the wrong place.

19:28.500 --> 19:29.580
I'm sorry.

19:29.670 --> 19:33.500
I thought the people from the baseball
and soccer clubs came back.

19:35.250 --> 19:37.970
Well, what did they do?

19:38.050 --> 19:41.800
My cute junior went
to mediate their disputes.

19:41.890 --> 19:44.010
But they didn't listen to advice

19:44.100 --> 19:47.180
and continued
their embarrassing bickering, didn't they?

19:47.270 --> 19:49.350
That's why I gave them a slight...

19:50.190 --> 19:51.690
A slight warning.

19:52.100 --> 19:53.360
I see.

19:53.900 --> 19:54.900
No, but

19:54.980 --> 19:57.230
isn't using a bamboo sword too much?

19:57.900 --> 19:59.490
Don't worry.

19:59.570 --> 20:01.740
I can kill with my fists,

20:01.820 --> 20:04.120
but I've never killed anyone
with a bamboo sword.

20:04.200 --> 20:05.240
I see.

20:05.330 --> 20:07.700
That's because the bamboo sword
will break before that.

20:10.370 --> 20:12.620
I think I once heard a guy

20:12.710 --> 20:17.300
call Sarashina "boss lady."

20:17.670 --> 20:18.800
I see it now.

20:20.050 --> 20:21.720
Touya!

20:23.180 --> 20:25.640
You don't have to be so nervous, Kuze.

20:25.720 --> 20:27.970
Chisaki didn't use violence on them.

20:28.270 --> 20:31.520
She just threatened them
with her violent background.

20:31.600 --> 20:32.900
Hold on, Touya.

20:34.350 --> 20:36.820
Goodness.

20:36.900 --> 20:38.230
I'm sorry.

20:38.320 --> 20:40.320
What a heartwarming interaction.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.400
Come on.

20:41.490 --> 20:43.110
Goodness.

20:43.200 --> 20:44.030
- Chisaki.
- Goodness.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.030
You'll dislocate my shoulder.

20:45.120 --> 20:47.200
- You'll dislocate it.
- Idiot.

20:47.280 --> 20:49.290
It's heart... warming?

20:51.000 --> 20:52.410
I'm sorry.

20:52.500 --> 20:54.880
Am I too late?

20:55.500 --> 20:56.500
Goodness.

20:56.590 --> 20:59.800
That's enough fooling around
in the student council office.

20:59.880 --> 21:02.510
No, it's not like that.

21:02.590 --> 21:05.300
I'm sorry. Does it hurt?

21:06.680 --> 21:07.890
I'm fine.

21:07.970 --> 21:09.430
My shoulders were a bit stiff,

21:09.520 --> 21:10.680
so it was perfect.

21:11.140 --> 21:12.980
I'm really sorry.

21:13.060 --> 21:15.600
I can never get the right amount of force.

21:15.690 --> 21:17.190
Which warrior tribe are you from?

21:17.690 --> 21:18.690
It's fine.

21:18.770 --> 21:20.900
This is what I've been working out for.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.400
Just bring it on.

21:23.610 --> 21:24.490
Touya...

21:24.570 --> 21:25.450
What?

21:25.530 --> 21:27.370
Was there a trigger for this sweet mood?

21:29.240 --> 21:31.200
Goodness, you're going too far.

21:33.460 --> 21:34.290
Say,

21:34.370 --> 21:37.420
if Sarashina is called Boss Lady,

21:37.500 --> 21:39.460
will she bind her chest in sarashi?

21:39.550 --> 21:41.170
Why would you think that?

21:41.260 --> 21:43.010
No, if that's the case,

21:43.090 --> 21:45.590
she'll be Sarashina in sarashi.

21:47.510 --> 21:50.510
My goodness. You two are so close.

21:51.100 --> 21:52.270
No, we're not.

21:53.770 --> 21:55.850
It seems we can't hide it
from your sister.

21:55.940 --> 21:56.810
What?

21:56.900 --> 21:59.110
Our close relationship.

21:59.190 --> 22:00.020
Shut up.

22:00.980 --> 22:02.190
Excuse me.

22:04.070 --> 22:05.610
I'm sorry.

22:05.700 --> 22:07.320
I'm a little late.

22:08.030 --> 22:09.580
Don't worry about it, Suou.

22:11.830 --> 22:12.660
Well then,

22:12.740 --> 22:15.080
let's start the student council meeting.

22:15.160 --> 22:17.120
- Let's do our best.
- Let's do our best.

22:17.500 --> 22:18.710
Well then, Kuze,

22:18.790 --> 22:21.210
could you introduce yourself
to everyone again?

22:21.300 --> 22:22.210
Yes.

22:23.260 --> 22:24.090
This time,

22:24.170 --> 22:27.720
I'm honored to join the student council
as the general affairs officer.

22:27.800 --> 22:29.010
I'm Masachika Kuze.

22:29.390 --> 22:32.180
Next year, I plan to join Alisa Kujou

22:32.470 --> 22:34.680
for the student council president election.

22:36.350 --> 22:38.900
I look forward to working with all of you.
